exports[`unique-names golden outputs (niche pack must keep these byte-for-byte) > closing card prompts and shots 1`] = `
{
  "boy|1": "Professional studio baby photoshoot photograph, photorealistic, fine art baby photography; one frame from a full session with the same baby.
Subject (the same baby in every photo of this session): a 1-year-old baby boy, with very fine short hair, light skin and big curious eyes.
Shot: the closing frame of the session, wide eye-level shot of the baby crawling happily across the blanket toward the viewer beside the main prop, low in the frame.
Backdrop: smooth seamless chocolate brown studio backdrop with a soft darker vignette.
Outfit: a tiny cream knitted romper with a little collar.
Props: wicker basket, pampas grass, felt bunny.
Lighting: soft warm light from the left, gentle shadows, cozy.
Color palette: brown, cream, oat and soft gold.
Photography: eye level, wide shot, 35mm lens, f/2.0, soft background falloff, high detail, natural skin.
Composition: square frame, the backdrop fills the whole frame; the baby and the props sit in the lower half of the frame, and the upper half of the frame is calm, open backdrop: smooth, softly lit and empty, with generous space above the baby's head.
No text, no letters, no words, no logo, no watermark anywhere.",
  "boy|2": "Professional studio toddler photoshoot photograph, photorealistic, fine art child photography; one frame from a full session with the same toddler.
Subject (the same toddler in every photo of this session): a 2-year-old toddler boy, with fine light brown hair, light skin and big curious eyes.
Shot: the closing frame of the session, wide eye-level shot of the toddler sitting on the blanket beside the main prop, low in the frame, smiling at the viewer.
Backdrop: smooth seamless chocolate brown studio backdrop with a soft darker vignette.
Outfit: a tiny cream knitted romper with a little collar.
Props: wicker basket, pampas grass, felt bunny.
Lighting: soft warm light from the left, gentle shadows, cozy.
Color palette: brown, cream, oat and soft gold.
Photography: eye level, wide shot, 35mm lens, f/2.0, soft background falloff, high detail, natural skin.
Composition: square frame, the backdrop fills the whole frame; the toddler and the props sit in the lower half of the frame, and the upper half of the frame is calm, open backdrop: smooth, softly lit and empty, with generous space above the toddler's head.
No text, no letters, no words, no logo, no watermark anywhere.",
  "boy|3": "Professional studio toddler photoshoot photograph, photorealistic, fine art child photography; one frame from a full session with the same toddler.
Subject (the same toddler in every photo of this session): a 3-year-old boy (a little preschooler), with fine light brown hair, light skin and big curious eyes.
